    User[User / Helm] -->|creates| SampleMS
    SampleMS -->|instance of| CRD
    CRD -->|watched by| Controller
    Controller -->|reads baseConfigMapRef| Presets
    Controller -->|creates| EPP
    Controller -->|creates| Decode
    Controller -->|creates| Prefill
    Controller -->|creates| Pool
    Controller -->|creates| GenRBAC
    Controller -.->|sim preset| Sim
    Decode --- Sidecar
    Gateway -->|routes| HTTPRoute
    HTTPRoute -->|backendRef| Pool
    Gateway -->|ext_proc gRPC| EPP
    DR -.->|configures TLS to| EPP
    EPP -->|KV-cache index| Redis
    Sidecar -->|P/D prefill| Prefill
    Prefill <-->|NIXL :5557 / UCX| Decode
    Decode -->|LMCache lookup| Redis

    Installer -->|runs| Deps
    Installer -->|helm upgrade -i| Chart
    Installer -.->|optional| Grafana

    Controller -->|K8s API| K8s[Kubernetes API]
    Decode -->|model pull| HF[Hugging Face Hub]
    Prefill -->|model pull| HF
    Gateway -->|provided by| Istio[Istio / kgateway]

